# Cursor rules — Council of AI estate (align any Cursor session top-down)
- Measurement, not certification. Never use certified/approved/accredited.
- Grammar locked: "13 measured of 14", "verified measurement credential". UNMEASURED reported, never hidden.
- Deterministic predicates only — never an LLM judge. Fail closed: INCOMPLETE never passes.
- The firewall: nobody ranked pays, humans never pay, money buys access never standing (RULING-2026-08-20).
- Corrections appended, never edited. The ledger applies to us first.
- No banned codenames (sov3/sovos/defoneos/byzantine/bft/33-agent) anywhere.
- Sign only with a real key; off the signing node, cards stay UNSIGNED and labelled.
- csoai-harness: select axes -> run deterministic scorers -> signed receipt -> upsell doors (automate/play/train/fix = MEOK lane).
- Autofix loop: run -> verify -> diff vs frozen provision -> emit fix-candidate (never auto-apply) -> re-measure -> signed.
